                  "key": "lat",
                  "value": "<number>",
                  "description": "Returns places (subject added entry-geographic names from marc 651) and related resources near a point defined by lat (latitude) and lon (longitude) and optionally dist (distance) in metres (default: 1000).\n\nExample: lat=47.378169444"
