                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "q",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Returns places (subject added entry-geographic names from marc 651) and related resources for the search term (q).The parameter \"q\" is alternative to \"lat\"/\"lon\".\n\nExample: q=bern"
